\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces E1 in two levels for the sound nets, training log (59,139 visits, 82 sequences). Level 1: share of fitting visits and escaping-edges precision (ProM 6.15, Section~\ref {sec:exp_discovery_eval}); Gen.: new test sequences accepted, of 16. Level 2: training sequences the net rejects, above the coverage threshold (of 17) and below it (of 65), and the share of the truck-minutes (sum of the turnaround times), of the visits above the training P90 of 64 minutes and of the multi-block visits that the rejected visits make up. Coverage check: accepts every sequence above the coverage threshold. \textsuperscript  {a}\,ETConformance rejects 30 fitting visits of IM 0.0 (Section~\ref {sec:res_e1_level1}). The prefix tree is a reference, not a candidate.}}{62}{table.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:rq1_e1_levels}{{6.1}{62}{E1 in two levels for the sound nets, training log (59,139 visits, 82 sequences). Level 1: share of fitting visits and escaping-edges precision (ProM 6.15, Section~\ref {sec:exp_discovery_eval}); Gen.: new test sequences accepted, of 16. Level 2: training sequences the net rejects, above the coverage threshold (of 17) and below it (of 65), and the share of the truck-minutes (sum of the turnaround times), of the visits above the training P90 of 64 minutes and of the multi-block visits that the rejected visits make up. Coverage check: accepts every sequence above the coverage threshold. \textsuperscript {a}\,ETConformance rejects 30 fitting visits of IM 0.0 (Section~\ref {sec:res_e1_level1}). The prefix tree is a reference, not a candidate}{table.caption.29}{}}
