\newlabel{fig:res_e1_tradeoff_train}{{6.1}{63}{Share of fitting visits and precision of the discovered nets on the training log (ProM 6.15). Left: all nets. Right: the nets with more than 91\,\% fitting visits and a precision above 0.7. Hollow markers: unsound nets, values for diagnosis only. The prefix tree accepts exactly the training sequences and serves as a reference}{figure.caption.30}{}}
